# Prompt
The project allows the generation of source codes on a programming language based on textual description.
The approach is writing a prompt for one single file on programming language.
The prompt and other parameters are described in *.svi files, which generate the corresponding
files with source code. Some files don't generate any file and are reused in another files
as a part of a prompt (like 'require' in programming languages).

General requirements:
If you need to import fs and/or path, please import in the following way (not to break vitests)
```ts
import fs from "fs";
import path from "path";
```